      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palacios%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The arrival of the Southern Pacific Railroad and the Texas Baptist Encampment turned the area into a seaside resort town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
