      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palacios%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Palacios is a birdwatcher's paradise, consistently reporting more species than any U.S. town in the Audubon Christmas Bird Count.",
